OL,3,GNEWSASex abuse PE teacher on remand
OL,4,Aahead of sentencing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sentencing date has been fixed for a
OL,7,Fformer PE teacher who groomed young
OL,8,Fpeople with "calculated precision".
OL,10,FBronwen James, 30, was found guilty of
OL,11,Fthe sexual abuse of a 16-year-old boy
OL,12,Fwhile employed at Bitterne Park School
OL,13,Fin Southampton. She also had admitted
OL,14,Fto sexual offences against two teenage
OL,15,Fgirls, one of whom went to Hardenhuish
OL,16,FSchool in Chippenham, Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
