OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSASex abuse PE teacher on remand
OL,4,Aahead of sentencing
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior crown prosecutor Bethany Adams
OL,7,Fpreviously said the former teacher
OL,8,F"manipulated her victims with
OL,9,Fcalculated precision" while the NCPCC
OL,10,Fsaid she had "exploited" a "position of
OL,11,Ftrust".
OL,13,FJames appeared at Winchester Crown
OL,14,FCourt earlier and was remanded in
OL,15,Fcustody ahead of a sentencing date of
OL,16,F15 January at the same court.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
